      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ソレイアさん！？\n僕をここに連れてきたのは、あなたなんですか？\nここはどこなんですか？　ていうか、なんで！？",
      "jp_sha256": "855eb2fd411e1a34c075b94349a4eab3ba3f9a61d47fe570461a0dfd1a6fb51b",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "소레이아 씨!?\n저를 여기로 데려온 게 당신인가요?\n여기는 어디죠? 아니, 대체 왜요!?",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 17,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "5918f766d01f792e52eab323cddd31db7457e5e544fa2d54b7ea0e4908997141:000002_659758113594754160:g0:r16",
      "row_index_0based": 16,
      "serialized_row_index": 16,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ソレイアさん！？\n僕をここに連れてきたのは、あなたなんですか？\nここはどこなんですか？　ていうか、なんで！？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a77f6cacc44f7c98245db12872866f75865e250f36a3f15fcef044eb44ac86bb",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "まぁまぁ、まずは落ち着くのだ。\nここはゲシュペンス島の山岳地帯。\n妾だけが知っている秘密の洞窟だ。",
      "jp_sha256": "317953c83600aaa932fdd1cb12b6f8cf4742d62602ddd85ed844078b4ae1cbd4",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "자자, 우선 진정하거라.\n이곳은 게슈펜스 섬의 산악 지대.\n짐만이 알고 있는 비밀 동굴이다.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 18,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
